WEBVTT

00:00:59.192 --> 00:01:03.053
An estimated 73 percent
of Latinx youth voted for Biden.

00:01:03.077 --> 00:01:05.527
As members of the largest
generation globally,

00:01:05.551 --> 00:01:07.428
these Latino youth mirror their peers,

00:01:07.452 --> 00:01:09.701
seeking intervention for climate equity,

00:01:09.725 --> 00:01:10.889
racial justice

00:01:10.913 --> 00:01:12.277
and gender parity.

00:01:12.301 --> 00:01:15.623
What we're hearing right now in America
and around the globe

00:01:15.647 --> 00:01:20.266
is a demand for a massive reset
on how we will govern in the 21st century

00:01:20.290 --> 00:01:21.937
for a world that is livable,

00:01:21.961 --> 00:01:23.977
equitable and just.

00:01:24.455 --> 00:01:26.853
Too many young people
are drowning in student debt

00:01:26.877 --> 00:01:28.042
here in America,

00:01:28.066 --> 00:01:30.493
their families have been ravaged
by the pandemic,